org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-db[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Add the WRITE theme and split JOB blocks by work kind[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Every past and open JOB Pomodoro carries the work-kind theme its [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]content supports (READ, WRITE, CHORE, PLAN, or BUILD) in one [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]verified, revertable vault commit. WRITE is a live, pinned theme [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]that shows in Recent. JOB is hidden. `bob themes list` reports no [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]false rename reappearances.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]write_theme_and_job_split.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/write_theme_and_job_split.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-db[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-db/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]`bob themes split` and the reappearance fix[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]split_cmd[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]split_cmd: add the template and map-driven per-entry theme split on the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]shared vault-rewrite transaction, and stop renamed_reappeared from [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reporting re-adopted names, with tests and docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Split the live JOB blocks and add WRITE[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]vault_migrate[dim] · [dim][/dim]after split_cmd[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]vault_migrate: hide JOB, split its 89 blocks with the planned mapping in[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]one vault commit, pin WRITE (and the standing set), and verify list, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stats, and sync.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-db","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-db.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-9555fa6cd745ad3b2abe3ff9a2b950f2","started_at":"2026-10-27T21:12:17.071776+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"7aa623f1729cf643ce85bbf463509854af02c5cbcd019e9169b59c603da33b9b","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-db.land/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"b80d4b46ee9bbdc0ce4d75494a9ec2c6802ab90ed851037a3d299906d6291825","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-db.land/meta.json","size_bytes":677},"prompt":{"digest":"877a095e6527af68679982a23b4c3d396d6757ee991f5a42799db91d2d288014","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-db.land/prompt.md","size_bytes":203},"state":{"digest":"8b4865c5bef4dfd70e64e105036f4598fb82a231b5b39a16d739debbb243eb70","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-db.land/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-db.land","local_name":"bob-cli-db.land","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-db","agent_clan_generation":"20261027171147","bead_id":"bob-cli-db","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-db","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-astra","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub","wait_for_beads":["bob-cli-db.1","bob-cli-db.2"]},"source_run_id":"run-b52a93c8341e8a74b12d21fedc514204","started_at":"20261027171149","state